Abarahama,m,,Shona,A-ɓa-ra-ha-ma,,,,,,,"Means ""one who has birthed or fathered relatives"", derived from Shona kubara ""to bear offspring, to bud"" and hama ""relatives"". This is the Shona equivalent of Abraham."
