Abelleus,m,,Arthurian Cycle,,,,,,,,"The object of Tor's first quest in Le Morte d'Arthur by Mallory. Abelleus stole a white brachet from Arthur's hall; Tor tracked him down and retrieved it. Having promised Abelleus's head to the hound's owner, Tor reluctantly decapitated him."
