Abesti,f,,Basque (Rare),[a.β̞e̞s̺.t̪i],,,,,,,"Coined by Sabino Arana Goiri who based the name on Basque abes ""to sing"" and the suffix -ti. According to R. M. Azkue, by 1927 abesti had acquired the meaning ""song"" and has been in everyday use as a synonym for the older kanta ever since."
