Abheda,m,,Buddhism,,,,,,,,"In Buddhism, Arhat Abheda (also known as Abhedya or Subinda) is one of the Sixteen Great Arhats, legendary disciples of the Buddha tasked with protecting the Dharma until the arrival of the future Buddha, Maitreya. He is revered in Mahayana and Vajrayana traditions as an eternal custodian of the teachings."
