Abhijnaraja,m,,Buddhism,,,,,,,,"Abhijnaraja is a highly revered figure in Tibetan Buddhism, best known as the ""King of Clear Knowing"" or ""King of Supreme Knowledge"". He is one of the Eight Medicine Buddhas who make up the healing mandala. His name derives from the Sanskrit term abhijna, which means ""higher knowledge,"" ""direct perception,"" or ""supernormal knowledge"""
