Adamari,f,,"Spanish (Latin American, Rare)|American (Hispanic, Rare)",,,,,,,,"Variant of Adamaris.A noted bearer is Puerto Rican actress Adamari López (b.1971). Known for her roles in several Puerto Rican and Mexican telenovelas, she is currently a host on the Telemundo morning show 'Un Nuevo Día'."
