Agalone,m,,Arthurian Cycle,,,,,,,,"A king in Arthur's service in La Tavola Ritonda. Agalone served as steward of Britain, along with a fellow king named Allielle, while Arthur was away in Gaul. He thus occupies the role assigned to CARADOC SHORTARM in the Prose Tristan."
