Ağaməli,m,,Azerbaijani (Rare),,,,,,,,"Means ""my master is (Imam) Ali"", from Azerbaijani ağa meaning ""lord, master"", the Turkic possessive suffix -m, and the name Əli. Also see Ağamalı."
Ağamalı,m,,Azerbaijani (Rare),,,,,,,,"Means ""my master is Ali"", from Azerbaijani ağa meaning ""lord, master"", first person possesive suffix -m, and the name Ali 1. Alternatively this name may come from Azerbaijani ağa and mal meaning ""property"" (accusative malı)."
