Agathandros,m,Ἀγάθανδρος(Ancient Greek),Ancient Greek,,,,,,,,"Derived from Ancient Greek ἀγαθός (agathos) meaning ""good"" combined with ἀνδρός (andros) meaning ""of a man"" (compare Agathanor)."
