Agrapina,f,აგრაფინა(Georgian),Georgian (Rare),,,,,,,,"Georgian form of Agrippina, possibly via its Russian form Agrafena.This is the standard Georgian form of the Roman name. The form Agripina (აგრიფინა), which is closer to the original, is also used in Georgia, but it has always been much rarer."
