Ahimaaz,m,אחימעץ(Ancient Hebrew),Biblical|English,,,,,,,,"From Hebrew אֲחִימַעַץ‎ (ʾĂḥīmaʿaṣ) meaning ""brother of the council"", from the combination of אָח (ʾaḥ) meaning ""brother"" and מוֹעָצָה (mo'atsá) meaning ""council"". This was the name of the son of the high priest Zadok, who was the first to bring the news of the defeat of Absalom to King David."
