Akebono​,,曙(Japanese Kanji)|あけぼの(Japanese Hiragana)|アケボノ(Japanese Katakana),Japanese (Rare),[ä.ke̞.bo̞.no̞],,,,,,,"From 曙 (akebono) meaning ""dawn, daybreak,"" derived from a combination of 明け (ake) meaning ""daybreak"" and 仄 (hono) meaning ""faint.""This name is rarely given, if at all."
