Akepsimas,m,Ἀκεψιμᾶς(Ancient Greek)|Ακεψιμάς(Greek),Middle Persian (Hellenized)|History (Ecclesiastical),,,,,,,,"Hellenized form of the Persian name Aqebshma, of which the meaning is still uncertain.This was the name of a Christian saint and martyr, a bishop of Hnaita in western Persia who was tortured to death in 376 AD."
