Akessamenos,m,"Ἀκεσσάμενος, Ἀκεσσαμενός, Ἀκεσαμενός(Ancient Greek)",Greek Mythology,,,,,,,,"Uncertain etymology. In Greek Mythology, this was the name of a Thracian king of Pieria and eponymous founder of the Macedonian city Akesamenai."
