Albray,f,,Medieval English,,,,,,,,Vernacular form of Albreda.
Albrea,f,,Medieval English (Latinized),,,,,,,,"Feminization of both Albericus and, in early medieval times, of Alfred."
Albrechta,f,,Dutch (Rare),,,,,,,,Feminine form of Albrecht.
Albreda,f,,Medieval German|Medieval English,ahl-BREH-dah(Medieval German),,,,,,,Medieval German feminine form of Alberich.
