Almandine,f,,English (Rare),,,,,,,,"From the word for the deep red garnet, which was derived from a corruption of Latin alabandicus ""of Alabanda"", as described by Pliny the Elder. Alabanda is an ancient Carian city known for its garnet gemstones. The city itself was derived from the given name Alabandus."
