Alok,m,"आलोक(Hindi, Marathi)|আলোক(Bengali, Assamese)|ଆଲୋକ(Odia)|ਅਲੋਕ(Gurmukhi)",Hindi|Bengali|Odia|Marathi|Punjabi|Assamese,/ˈɑː.loːk/(Hindi)|/ˈa.lok/(Bengali)|/a.ˈlo.kɔ/(Odia),,,,,,,"From Sanskrit आलोक (āloka) meaning ""light, lustre, splendour, illumination""."
