Alongkon,m,อลงกรณ์(Thai),Thai,/ʔa˨˩.loŋ˧.ˈkɔːn˧/,,,,,,,"Means ""ornament, decoration"" in Thai, ultimately from Sanskrit अलङ्करण (alaṅkaraṇa)."
