Aloxi,m,,Catalan (?),,,,,,,,Varant of Louis.
Aloy,f,,Popular Culture,,,,,,,,Aloy is the protagonist in the 2017 video game Horizon Zero Dawn and its upcoming sequel Horizon Forbidden West.
Aloyis,m,,Walloon,,,,,,,,Walloon form of Aloïs.
Aloyoshenka,m,,Russian (Rare),,,,,,,,Variant of Alyosha.
Aloys,m,,Dutch|German|German (Silesian),"AH-lois(German, Silesian German)",,,,,,,"German variant and Silesian German form of Alois, and Dutch short form of Aloysius."
