Alrescha,f,,Astronomy,/æl.ˈriː.ʃə/,,,,,,,"This is the name of a binary star system Alpha Piscium in the constellation Pisces. The system bore the traditional name Alrescha (alternatively Al Rescha, Alrischa, Alrisha) derived from the Arabic الرشآء al-rishā’ ""the cord"" and less commonly Kaitain and Okda, the latter from the Arabic عقدة ʽuqdah ""knot""."
