Amazing,,,English (Rare),/ə.ˈmeɪ.zɪŋ/,,,,,,,"From the English word amazing, which is derived from Old English āmasian meaning ""to confound"". This name is chiefly used in countries that has English as their secondary language, such as African countries or the Philippines."
