Amoena,f,,"German (Rare, Archaic)",,,,,,,,"Derived from Latin amoenus, -a, -um ""charming; delightful; pleasant"", this name was occasionally used in German-speaking countries from the 1500s onward. It is, however, all but extinct in this day and age."
