Anżelika,f,,Polish (Rare),ahn-zheh-LEE-kah|ahn-ZHEH-lee-kah,,,,,,,"Polish transcription of Анжелика or Анжеліка (see Anzhelika. Rarely used as a Polish alternate form of Angelika, possibly influenced by the word ""anżelika"", which refers to candied Angelica, or to the plant Angelica in general."
