Apridon,m,აფრიდონ(Georgian),Georgian (Archaic),,,,,,,,"Georgian form of Afrīdōn (also found spelled as Afrīdūn), which is the arabized form of the Persian name Fereydūn (see Fereydoun). Also compare the Middle Persian form of Fereydūn, which is Frēdōn."
