Aramanyak,m,Արամանեակ(Old Armenian)|Արամանյակ(Armenian),Ancient Armenian,,,,,,,,"Meaning unknown; possibly related to Persian ارمنی (Armani) ""Armenian"" or from Old Iranian *Rāma(n)-nī- ""bringing peace"" combined with the Armenian suffix -ակ (-ak). Aramanyak Haykazuni was a king of Armenia from 2026-1980 BCE. He was supposedly the son of Hayk, the legendary founder of Armenia."
