Arambiy,m,Арамбий(Western Circassian),Adyghe,/ɐ.rɐmʲ.ˈbʲiɪ̯/(Russian)|/ɐ.rɐm.ˈbʲiɪ̯/(Russian),,,,,,,"Derived from Persian آرام (ârâm) meaning ""quiet, calm, tranquil""and the Turkish military title beg meaning ""chieftain, master""."
