Arca,,,Turkish,ahr-JAH,,,,,,,"Stemming from the Old Turkic root arı- or arun- meaning ""pure, clean, untainted, free from blemish"". It symbolizes crystal clarity, spiritual innocence, and the essence of a soul free from burdens. It emphasizes an unblemished and noble character."
