Argiris,m,,"Greek (Rare)|Greek (Cypriot, Rare)",,,,,,,,Variant of Argyris.
Argisht,m,Արգիշտի(Armenian),Armenian,,,,,,,,"Very old name used by an real king of Armenia.Was the sixth known king of the ancient country of Urartu (in eastern Anatolia) from 785 BC to 763 BC.He founded the citadel of Erebouni in 782 BC, which is the present capital of Armenia, Yerevanreference Wikipedia"
Argishti,m,,Urartian|Ancient Armenian|Armenian,[ɑɾ.ɡiʃ.ˈti](Eastern Armenian),,,,,,,"The name of two kings of Urartu, an ancient kingdom in the Armenian Highlands."
