Aribert,m,,Germanic|German|French,,,,,,,,"Germanic variant of Haribert, though there can also easily be cases where the name is a variant of Arabert and Arinbert (see Arnbert).A notable bearer of this name was the German composer Aribert Reimann (1936-2024)."
