Arildo,m,,Portuguese (Brazilian),,,,,,,,"This given name is predominantly in use in Brazil. It is probably the (Brazilian) Portuguese form of Arild. Also compare Araldo and Aroldo.A known bearer of this name is the Brazilian politician Arildo Batista, who is president of the council of Jacareí, a city in southern Brazil."
