Arinniti,f,,Ancient Near Eastern,Areen-EE-tee,,,,,,,"Hittite name meaning ""lady of the forest"", from Sanskrit aranya meaning ""forest"". This name was given to the Sun Goddess of Arinna. Also connected to the Vedic goddess Aranyani."
