Arisa,f,"ありさ(Japanese Hiragana)|有沙, 有紗, etc.(Japanese Kanji)",Japanese|Albanian,/ä.ɾi.sä/,,,,,,,"From Japanese 有 (ari) meaning ""to possess, exist"" and 沙 (sa) meaning ""sand"" or 紗 (sa) meaning ""silk, gauze"". Other kanji combinations are possible. This name is often spelled in hiragana."
