Arizia,f,,Medieval Basque,,,,,,,,"Medieval Basque name of uncertain origin and meaning, even though it might be a feminine form of Ariz. It was first recorded in Navarre in 1274."
Arizolia,f,,Spanish,A-ri-ZO-li-a,,,,,,,"Based off the name/place Arizona and influenced by the name Aeolia. I picture a strong girl who understands their own emotions and strengths, someone who can be bright as a star and sharp as a knife.Arizona Aeolia feminine fantasy #c.ai"
