Artazostre,f,Ἀρταζώστρη(Ancient Greek),Old Persian (Hellenized)|History,,,,,,,,"Hellenized form of Old Persian *Artazauštrī meaning ""who is in favor of Arta/Ṛta, the deified Truth"" or ""who is devoted to Arta"". This name was borne by a Persian princess (5th century BC); Artazostre was the daughter of Darius the Great by his wife Artystone."
