Artham,m,,Literature,ARE-thm,,,,,,,"Variant of Arthur, used in Andrew Peterson's Wingfeather Saga. The character was inspired by the author's brother, Arthur."
Arthas,m,,Popular Culture (?),,,,,,,,The name of a character from the online game 'World of Warcraft'. It is obviously derived from the name Arthus.
