Arvelodi,m,არველოდი(Georgian),Georgian (Rare),,,,,,,,"Basically means ""I had not expected you"", derived from the Georgian particle არ (ar) meaning ""not, no"" combined with Georgian ველოდი (velodi) meaning ""I expected"", which ultimately comes from the verb ლოდინი (lodini) meaning ""to expect, to await"".This name literally refers to the fact that the child in question was unexpected by its parents."
