Asralt,,Асралт(Mongolian Cyrillic)|ᠠᠰᠠᠷᠠᠯᠲᠤ(Traditional Mongolian),Mongolian,,,,,,,,"Means ""merciful, compassionate"" in Mongolian."
Asrar,,أسرار(Arabic)|اسرار(Urdu),Arabic|Urdu,,,,,,,,"Derived from أسرار (asrar), which is the plural of the Arabic noun سر (sirr) meaning ""secret, mystery"". In Iran, this is also the name of a daily newspaper.Known bearers of this name include the Indian Urdu poets Majaz (1911-1955) and Majrooh Sultanpuri (1919-2000), whose real first name was Asrar."
