Astydamea,f,,Greek Mythology (Latinized),,,,,,,,Latinized form of Astydameia.
Astydameia,f,Ἀστυδάμεια(Ancient Greek),Greek Mythology,/ə.ˌstɪ.də.ˈmiː.ə/(English),,,,,,,"Derived from Ancient Greek ἄστυ (asty) meaning ""town, city"" and δαμάζω (damazo) meaning ""to tame, subdue""."
Astydamia,f,,Greek Mythology (Latinized),,,,,,,,Latinized form of Astydameia. In Greek myth this name belonged to five individual characters.
