Azmaveth,m,עַזְמָוֶת(Ancient Hebrew),Biblical,AZ-mə-veth(Biblical English),,,,,,,"This name is comprised of two parts: עז ('az) meaning ""power, to be strong"" and מוות (mavet) meaning ""death"". Some sources claim the combined meaning of this name is ""Death is Strong"".This name is used many times in the Bible. It is also the name of a town mentioned in Nehemiah 12:29."
