Balinor,m,,Popular Culture (Rare)|Arthurian Cycle,BAL-in-NOR(Popular Culture),,,,,,,"The name Balinor has no known meaning. However, it was once used in the television series 'Merlin' (2008–2012) where the character Balinor was the father of Merlin and a former Dragonlord.The name could also be related to the name Balin from Arthurian Legend as well."
