Bêlim,f,,Kurdish,,,,,,,,"Means ""stem"" in Kurdish."
Belimir,m,,Croatian,BEL-ee-meer,,,,,,,"The first element of this name is derived from Proto-Slavic bělъ ""white, pale"". Also see Běla, which is of the same etymology. The second element is derived from Slavic mir ""peace""."
Belimira,f,,Croatian (Rare),beh-lee-MEE-rah,,,,,,,Feminine form of Belimir.
