Bellaflor,f,,Medieval Italian,,,,,,,,Variant of Bellaflore
Bellaflore,f,,Medieval Italian,,,,,,,,"Derived from Latin bella ""beautiful, charming, pleasant"" and a derivative of Latin flos ""flower""."
Bellag,f,,Scots,,,,,,,,Diminutive of Bell.
