Beloslava,f,Белослава(Bulgarian),Bulgarian,,,,,,,,Feminine form of Beloslav. Beloslava of Bulgaria was a Bulgarian princess and Queen consort of Serbia between 1234 and 1243. She was the wife of king Stefan Vladislav I.
