Bhagyalakshmi,f,भाग्यलक्ष्मी(Hindi),Hindi,/bʱɑːɡ.jᵊ.ˈlək.ʂmiː/,,,,,,,"From Sanskrit भाग्य (bhāgya) meaning ""luck, destiny, fate, fortune"" and the name of the Hindu goddess Lakshmi."
