Bizilla,f,,Near Eastern Mythology|Sumerian Mythology,,,,,,,,"Possibly means ""she who is pleasing"". Bizilla was a love goddess considered to be the ""sukkal"" (vizier deity) for the goddess Ninlil. She is occasionally counted among the courtiers of Inanna, and is also closely associated with Nanaya."
