Blakesley,f,,"English (American, Rare)",,,,,,,,"Transferred use of the surname Blakesley.An example of a bearer of this name is Blakesley Grace Sutter (b. 2009), the daughter of the American reality TV personality Ryan Sutter and his wife Trista."
