Blenda,f,,Swedish|Albanian,,,,,,,,"From a place name which was derived from Old Swedish blædh ""blade"". According to Swedish tradition, the place was named after a woman named Blenda who defended the land against invading Danes in the local men's absence. It is also associated with the Swedish verb blända meaning ""to dazzle, to blind""."
