Bloem,f,,Dutch (Rare),BLOOM,,,,,,,"Derived from the Dutch word bloem meaning ""flower"".In the Netherlands, the best known example of a bearer of this name is Bloem Van Landuyt (b. 2004), who is one of the daughters of Dutch actress Angela Schijf (b. 1979) and her husband Tom Van Landuyt (b. 1967), a Belgian actor."
