Bocephus,m,,English|Popular Culture,,,,,,,,"Likely a corruption of the Ancient Greek name Bucephalus.American country singer-songwriter Hank Williams, Jr. occasionally goes by the name Bocephus. His father gave him the nickname after Grand Ole Opry comedian Rod Brasfield's ventriloquist dummy. Bocephus King is a Canadian indie musician."
