Borgarhjǫrtr,f,,Norse Mythology,,,,,,,,"Derived from Old Norse borg ""fortress, citadel"" and hjǫrtr ""hart, stag"". In the Norse sagas, Þóra Borgarhjǫrtr is the second wife of Ragnar Loðbrók."
