Bregalad,m,,Literature,,,,,,,,"A fictional character created by J.R.R. Tolkien. Bregalad, known in the common tongue as Quickbeam, was an Ent at the time of the War of the Ring. He was significantly younger than elder Ents such as Treebeard. He guarded the rowan trees and resembled a rowan himself."
