Brilliana,f,,"English (Rare, Archaic)",,,,,,,,"Coined by Lord Conway in the early 17th century for his daughter (who would later become a well-known English letter-writer).At the time of his daughter's birth, Lord Conway was governor at Brill in the Netherlands - which is allegedly also the inspiration behind this name."
