Burglind,f,,"German (Rare, Archaic)",BUWRG-lint,,,,,,,"A dithematic name formed from the name elements burg ""castle, protected place"" and linta ""linden tree, lime; shield (made of lime wood); gentle, soft"".Burglind is the name of the first notable cyclone in Germany in 2018."
