Calcifer,m,,Literature,KAHL-sih-fer|KAL-sə-fər,,,,,,,"This is the name of a fire demon in the 1986 young adult fantasy novel Howl's Moving Castle, written by Diana Wynne Jones.Perhaps derived from French calcifier ""to calcify"", stemming from Latin calx ""lime, limestone"", or from calx ""lime"" and ferre ""to bring""."
