Calimero,m,,Italian,Kah-Lee-MEYH-Roh,,,,,,,"Calimero is originally derived from the Greek Kallimeros, from Kalos meaning ""Beautiful; Noble,"" and Meros meaning ""Thigh; Leg"". Turning out to be, ""With Beautiful, Strong Legs""."
