Capheira,f,Καφείρα(Ancient Greek),Greek Mythology (Latinized),,,,,,,,"Partial latinization of Kapheira (as its proper latinized form is Caphira). In Greek mythology, Capheira was an Oceanid as a daughter of the Titan Oceanus, possibly by his sister-wife Tethys. Along with the Telchines, Capheira was tasked by Rhea to nurse the infant Poseidon."
Capheus,m,,Popular Culture,,,,,,,,"Variant of Cepheus.Capheus 'Van Damme' Onyango is one of the eight sensate main characters of 2015 sisters Wachowski's science-fiction TV series 'Sense8'. He lives in Nairobi, Kenya."
