Capricorn,m,,Astronomy,/ˈkæp.ɹɪ.ˌkɔːn/(British English)|/ˈkæp.ɹɪ.ˌkɔɹn/(American English),,,,,,,"From Latin Capricornus meaning ""horned like a goat"" (from caper, genitive capri ""goat"" and cornu ""horn""), a loan-translation of Greek Aigokheros, the name of the constellation. This is also the name of the tenth sign of the zodiac."
