Catti-brie,f,,Popular Culture|Literature,/ˈkæ.ti ˈbɹi/(English),,,,,,,"Catti-brie (spelled Cattie-brie in later publications) is the name of a character in the 'Forgotten Realms', a series of fantasy novels by American author R. A. Salvatore which serves as a setting for the role-playing game 'Dungeons & Dragons'. Salvatore based it on the initial syllables of Caitlin and Brielle, the first and middle names of his daughter."
