Chabi,f,Чаби(Mongolian Cyrillic)|ᠴᠠᠪᠢ(Traditional Mongolian),Medieval Mongolian,,,,,,,,"Empress Chabi (1225–1281) was a Khongirad empress consort of the Yuan dynasty in China, married to Kublai Khan. As such, she was the wife to the Mongol Khagan who had conquered all of China in the 1270s."
