Chemutai,f,,Kalenjin,Cheh - MOO - Ty,,,,,,,"Derives from the East African tribe, the Kalenjins. Like many other Kalenjin names, the first part of the name relates to the gender of the person and the second part is how, when, or where they were born. The 'Che' is feminine and '-mutai' means born near dawn."
