Chenekwahow,m,,Obscure,,,,,,,,"Of unknown origin and meaning.The name was given to a boy in Düsseldorf, Germany, in 1998. The naming made public headlines because his mother wanted to register 12 names for her baby but a court cut the name list short. The Bundesverfassungsgericht (Constitutional Court of Germany) ruled that a restriction to 5 names does not violate the German constitutional rights. The courts did not issue any rulings on the selected names."
