Christophilos,m,Χριστόφιλος(Ancient Greek),Late Greek,,,,,,,,"Means ""beloved Christ"" or ""friend of Christ"" in Greek. It is derived from the name of Christ combined with the Greek element φίλος (philos) meaning ""beloved, dear"" as well as ""friend, lover""."
Christophilus,m,,Late Greek (Latinized)|Dutch (Archaic)|English (Puritan),,,,,,,,Latinized form of Christophilos.
