Çisem,f,,Turkish,[tʃisɛm],,,,,,,"Çisem is a name that captures the essence of a ""gentle drizzle."" Derived from the root çis, it describes the light, rhythmic fall of rain that brings life to the soil. As a name, it is a symbol of quiet renewal and the soft, nurturing power of the sky, representing one who brings vitality and freshness wherever they travel."
