Col-hozeh,m,כל־חזה(Hebrew),Biblical,,,,,,,,"Means ""all-seeing"", ultimately derived from Hebrew כל (kol) meaning ""all, whole"" and חזה (haza) meaning ""to see, to have a vision"". He was mentioned in Nehemiah 3:15 and Nehemiah 11:5."
