Cush,m,כּוּשׁ(Ancient Hebrew),Biblical,,,,,,,,"The eldest son of Ham, who was a son of Noah. He was the brother of Mizraim (Egypt), Canaan (land of Canaan), and Phut, and the father of the Biblical character Nimrod mentioned in the ""Table of Nations"" in the Genesis 10:6 and I Chronicles 1:8."
