Dalkiel,m,,Judeo-Christian-Islamic Legend (Rare),,,,,,,,"A demon first mentioned by Joseph Gikatilla ben Abraham (1248-1305) in his book ""Baraita de Massachet Gehinnom"".According to him, Dalkiel is an angel of Hell, the ruler of Sheol, a place that is said to be four hundred twenty times hotter than fire. His task is to drive the souls of the damned to the seventh circle of Hell."
