Dato,m,დათო(Georgian),Georgian,/dɑ.tʰɔ/,,,,,,,"Short form of Davit. A notable bearer of this name is the Georgian pop singer Davit ""Dato"" Khujadze (b. 1975)."
D'Atra,f,,African American (Rare),dee-A-trə,,,,,,,"Variant of Deitra. D'Atra Hicks, born Deitra Cherelle Hicks (1967-) is an American actress and singer. Hicks is best known for her role as Jackie Simmons in Tyler Perry's 2002 stage play 'Madea's Family Reunion'."
