Đẩu,m,,Vietnamese,/ʔɗəw˧˩/|/ʔɗəw˧˨/|/ʔɗəw˨˩˦/,,,,,,,"From Sino-Vietnamese 斗 (đẩu) meaning ""dipper"", which can refer to various groups of stars, including the Big Dipper and one of the Twenty-Eight Mansions in Chinese astronomy, Dipper."
