Degen,,德根(Chinese),Chinese,,,,,,,,"Combination of the Chinese character 德 (see De) and 根 (see Gen).Other characters combinations are also possible.A famous bearer is Chen Degen, a Chinese cross-country skier who competes internationally. He represented his country at the 2022 Winter Olympics."
