Dehong,m,"德鸿, 德宏, 德洪, etc.(Chinese)|德鴻, 德宏, 德洪, etc.(Traditional Chinese)",Chinese,/tɤ.xʊŋ/,,,,,,,"From Chinese 德 (dé) meaning ""ethics, morality, virtue"" combined with 鸿 (hóng) meaning ""wild swan, great, vast"", 宏 (hóng) meaning ""wide, spacious, great, vast"" or 洪 (hóng) meaning ""flood, deluge, great, vast"". Other character combinations can form this name as well."
