Dhritisha,f,,Indian (Rare),Dhru-ti-sha,,,,,,,"Dhrutisha means Goddess Lakshmi and Goddess Parvati. Dhrutisha is made of two words, Dhruti and Isha. Dhruti means Goddess lakshmi, used to describe the quality of courage and patience of Goddess Lakshmi in Lakshmi Sahasras. Isha means Goddess Parvathi, as Lord shiva wife."
