Dhruthi,f,,Indian,Dhru-ti,,,,,,,"Dhruthi is considered an aspect of Goddess Lakshmi, representing her courageous and bold qualities. Dhruthi can be associated with the Goddess Lakshmi. The word Dhruthi/ Dhruti is mentioned in Lakshmi Sahasranama two times."
Dhruti,f,धृति(Sanskrit)|धृती(Marathi),Hinduism|Marathi,/ˈd̪ʱr̩.t̪i/(Sanskrit),,,,,,,"From Sanskrit धृति (dhṛti) meaning ""constancy, firmness, steadiness"". This is another name for the Hindu goddess Lakshmi."
