Dimeo,m,,"Dutch (Surinamese, Rare)",,,,,,,,"Meaning uncertain. It might possibly be derived from the Italian patronymic surname Di Meo, which is also found spelled as DiMeo and Dimeo.However, it could also be that this name is actually an alternate spelling of Timeo, in which case it might possibly have been influenced by names like Dimitri. It could even be a combination of the latter name with any masculine name that ends in -eo (such as Leo and Romeo).A notable bearer of this name is the Dutch basketball player Dimeo van der Horst (b. 1991), who is of Surinamese descent."
