Dingsheng,m,"鼎盛, etc.(Chinese)",Chinese,/tiŋ.ʂɤŋ/,,,,,,,"From Chinese 鼎盛 (dǐngshèng) meaning ""flourishing, prospering, in the prime of life"". Other hanzi combinations are possible."
