Diphda,f,,Astronomy,/ˈdɪf.də/,,,,,,,"From Arabic ضِفْدَع‎ (ḍifda') ""frog"", taken from the phrase ضفدع الثاني (aḍ-ḍifdaʿ aṯ-ṯānī) meaning ""the second frog"". This is the name of a star in the constellation Cetus."
