Disciplina,f,,Roman Mythology,/dis.ki.ˈpliː.na/(Classical Latin),,,,,,,"Derived from Latin disciplina, meaning ""instruction; discipline"". In Roman mythology, Disciplina was a minor deity and the personification of discipline."
