Donus,m,,Medieval Latin,DO-nəs,,,,,,,"Probably a variant of the Latin word domnus, meaning ""lord"" This was the name of a pope (676-678) and also a pope whose entire existence was from a misreading (Domnus de Sutri became Donus de Sutri, which become Donus II due to the previous Pope Donus)."
