Dorabella,f,,"Theatre|American (South, Rare, Archaic)",,,,,,,,"Dorabella is a character in Così fan tutte, ossia La scuola degli amanti (All Women Do It, or The School for Lovers; 1790 ), an opera buffa in two acts by Wolfgang Amadeus Mozart."
