Duamutef,m,,Egyptian Mythology,,,,,,,,"Means ""who adores his mother"". He is one of the four sons of Horus tasked with protecting his throne in the underworld. His image was depicted on the canopic jar which held the stomach of the deceased."
Duân,m,,Vietnamese,/zwən˧˧/|/jwəŋ˧˧/|/jəŋ˧˧/,,,,,,,Meaning unknown.
