Eldarion,m,,Literature,,,,,,,,"Means ""son of the Eldar"" or ""son of the Elves"". In J.R.R. Tolkien's appendixes within 'The Return of the King', Eldarion is the son of Aragorn and Arwen. He succeeds Aragorn as 'High King' of the two realms his father reunited."
