Engrevain,m,,Arthurian Cycle,,,,,,,,"A variant of Agravain. The second and probably the most unpleasant son of King Lot and Queen Margawse of Orkney (sometimes Anna), nicknamed aux dures mains (‘of the hard hands’). Brother of Gawain, Gaheris and Gareth, and Mordred. He married Laurel, the niece of Lionors and Lynette. He is a nephew of King Arthur."
