Enying,f,"恩莹, 恩影, 恩滢, 恩英(Chinese)",Chinese,,,,,,,,"From the Chinese 恩 (ēn) meaning ""kindness, mercy, charity"" and 莹 (yíng) meaning ""luster of gems, bright, lustrous"", 影 (yǐng) meaning ""shadow, image, reflection"" or 滢 (yíng) meaning ""clear, pure water; lucid, glossy"" or 英 (yīng) meaning ""hero, brave"" or ""flower, petal, leaf""."
