Enzaburou,m,"延三郎, 円三郎, 猿三郎, 廷三郎, etc.(Japanese Kanji)",Japanese,EN-SAH-BUU-ṘO:,,,,,,,"From Japanese 延 (en) meaning ""extend, lengthen"", 三 (zabu) meaning ""three"" combined with 郎 (rou) meaning ""son"". Other kanji combinations are possible as well."
Enzel,,,Turkish|Kurdish,,,,,,,,"From the Arabic اَنْزَلَ (enzele) meaning ""descended""."
Enzeru,f,"天使, etc.(Japanese Kanji)",Japanese,EN-ZE-ṘUU,,,,,,,"From Japanese 天使 (enzeru) meaning ""angel"". Other kanji combinations are possible.Usage of this name is, most likely, influenced by the word angel."
Enzhu,f,恩珠(Chinese),Chinese,,,,,,,,"From the Chinese 恩 (ēn) meaning ""kindness, mercy, charity"" and 珠 (zhū) meaning ""bead, pearl, gem""."
