Eretna,m,,Medieval Turkic,,,,,,,,"The name ""Eretna"" is popularly explained to have originated from the Sanskrit word ratna (रत्न) meaning 'jewel'.This name was common among the Uyghurs following the spread of Buddhism."
Eretria,f,,Popular Culture,ayr-ə-TREE-ə,,,,,,,"Eretria is a town in Euboea, Greece, facing the coast of Attica across the narrow South Euboean Gulf.Eretria is a main character in the TV show, The Shannara Chronicles, based on the character of the same name in the book, The Elfstones of Shannara. She is a Rover and the adopted daughter of Cephalo, the leader of their caravan of Rovers."
