Erilo,m,Ерило(Church Slavic),Slavic Mythology,,,,,,,,"Alternative name for Jarilo, Slavic god of spring, fertility, and erotic or sexual love. The name is derived from ""yary-"" (passionate). Depicted as a handsome, barefoot youth dressed in a white cloak and adorned with a crown of wildflowers, Jarilo rode on a white horse, his left hand holding a bucket of wheat seed."
