Erkhchölöö,,Эрхчөлөө(Mongolian Cyrillic),Mongolian,,,,,,,,"Means ""freedom, liberty"" in Mongolian, from эрх (erkh) meaning ""right, privilege"" or ""authority, power"" and чөлөө (chölöö) meaning ""freedom""."
