Erkhemzayaa,,Эрхэмзаяа(Mongolian Cyrillic),Mongolian,,,,,,,,"Derived from Mongolian эрхэм (erkhem) meaning ""important, supreme"" and заяа (zayaa) meaning ""future, destiny, fate""."
Erkhemzhargal,,Эрхэмжаргал(Mongolian Cyrillic),Mongolian,,,,,,,,"Derived from Mongolian эрхэм (erkhem) meaning ""important, supreme"" and жаргал (jargal) meaning ""happiness, blessing""."
