Erkim,f,,Kyrgyz|Turkish,,,,,,,,"This is a name of unknown origin used amongst the people of Kyrgyzstan. The Kyrgyz people are native to Central Asia, and are a nomadic people of Turkic and Mongol ethnic descent. The name Erkim is most prevalent in Turkey,Possibly related to the masculine given name Erkin."
Erkin,m,Эркин(Yakut),Yakut,,,,,,,,"Means ""fair"" in Yakut."
