Eularija,f,,Lithuanian,,,,,,,,Lithuanian form of Eularia.
Eulela,f,,English (Rare),,,,,,,,Variant of Eulalia.
Eulena,f,,"English (Rare, Archaic)|English (Rare, Archaic)",yoo-LE-nə,,,,,,,Not available.
Eulene,f,,English (Archaic),yoo-LEEN,,,,,,,Elaboration of Eula.
Eulenia,f,,"Portuguese (Brazilian, Rare)|English (American, Rare, Archaic)",,,,,,,,Not available.
