Exaenetus,m,,Ancient Greek (Latinized),,,,,,,,"Latinized form of Exainetos. A known bearer of this name was Exaenetus of Agrigentum (modern-day Agrigento), winner of the wrestling contest at the 71st Olympiad in 496 BC."
