Faram,m,,Arthurian Cycle,,,,,,,,"A Knight of the Round Table related to Erec.Faram met Galahad in the Uther Pendragon Abbey, where the latter was recuperating from a successful battle against King Mark of Cornwall. As Faram chatted with Galahad, Mark sneaked in and poisoned drinks meant for the two knights. God allowed Galahad to survive, but Faram perished."
