Fayrah,f,فرح(Arabic),Arabic,/f.ˈeɪ..ɹə/,,,,,,,"With Arabic origins, the name Fayrah means ""joyful,"" ""happy,"" or ""delight"". It is closely related to the Arabic root f-r-ḥ (فرح), which also forms other names, such as Farah and Farrah. It is a popular name among Islamic cultures, often chosen for its positive and uplifting connotations."
