Fiongalla,f,,Irish Mythology,,,,,,,,"Legend has it that she was held in enchantment by the powerful druid Amerach in Ireland. Amerach made Fiongalla vow never to sleep with a man until one brought magical yew berries, holly boughs, and marigolds from the earthly seat of power. A hero named Feargal actually managed to perform this almost impossible task, and won Fiongalla."
