Floralina,f,,Obscure,,,,,,,,"Likely an elaboration of Flora, or possibly a combination of Flora and Lina."
Floraline,f,,English (Rare),,,,,,,,A Victorian elaboration of the name Flora meaning “flower like”
Floramie,f,,American (?),,,,,,,,Name of customer service person who helped me online today
