Florelle,f,,"French|French (Belgian, Rare)",,,,,,,,Cognate of Florella.
Floremus,m,,Arthurian Cycle,,,,,,,,Seneschal of King Lac of Great Orkney.He joined Arthur’s forces against the Saxons at the battles of Clarence and Vambieres.
