Funkuro,m,,Ijaw,fu un ku ri,,,,,,,"Means ""knowledge is power"" in Ijaw."
Funmi,,,Yoruba,Foon-mee,,,,,,,"Means ""give to me"" in Yoruba. It can be used as a short form of names containing funmi, such as Funmilola and Olufunmilayo."
